{'symbol': 'MET', 'date': '2023-03-28 10:05:00', 'title': "METLIFE ONCE AGAIN EARNS 2023 ENERGY STAR® PARTNER OF THE YEAR ‘SUSTAINED EXCELLENCE' AWARD", 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--METLIFE, INC. (NYSE: MET) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS RECEIVED THE 2023 ENERGY STAR® PARTNER OF THE YEAR SUSTAINED EXCELLENCE AWARD FROM THE U.S. ENVIRONMENTAL PROTECTION AGENCY (EPA) AND THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF ENERGY.'}